{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "99c681dc-f75e-44b4-826d-9c1d77e95398",
    "name": "FT-TBD 在线智能体空间开放接入",
    "description": "FT-TBD 在线智能体空间服务化接口全量 HTTP 接口（不含 WebSocket）。\n\n导入：Postman → Import → 选择本文件。\n鉴权：服务化接口只校验请求头 X-Open-Access-Token（集合变量 openAccessToken，值为该组织的组织管理员或超级管理员在「组织单元设置 → Agent 设置」生成的 oat_xxx，绑定该组织），不再使用 PAT / JWT；需要成员身份/归属的请求必须带 userId（集合变量 userId，任意正整数，不必是真实 ASDM 用户）。\n不需要 userId 的接口：查询全部在线智能体空间、实例详情、暂停/重启、制品列表、按 artifactId 下载制品。\n注意：enter / connect 两个请求**必须**额外带 X-Asdm-Pat（集合变量 asdmPat，填调用方自己的个人 PAT），否则返回 400。\n先填 baseUrl（默认 http://localhost:5173）、openAccessToken、userId。\n实例、会话、制品等路径参数在对应请求的 Path Variables 里填写。\n注意：/api/v1/agentorbit/workspace-artifacts/** 是平台内部通道，仍走 JWT，不在本集合的服务化范围内。\n本集合不含「创建实例 / 删除实例 / 项目 CRUD」端点（这些能力由平台侧或其他通道提供）。",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. 实例管理",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1.1 查询全部在线智能体空间",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-Open-Access-Token", "value": "{{openAccessToken}}", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/agentorbit/workspaces",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "agentorbit",
                "workspaces"
              ]
            },
            "description": "查询平台内全部在线智能体空间实例（type=workspace、未删除），不限用户，按创建时间倒序；不需要 userId。"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "1.2 实例详情（兼作状态轮询）",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-Open-Access-Token", "value": "{{openAccessToken}}", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/agentorbit/workspaces/{{instanceId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "agentorbit",
                "workspaces",
                "{{instanceId}}"
              ],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "key": "instanceId",
                  "value": "",
                  "description": "实例 ID"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "查询实例详情，创建后可用它轮询 status 到 running。不需要 userId。"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "1.3 暂停实例",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-Open-Access-Token", "value": "{{openAccessToken}}", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/agentorbit/workspaces/{{instanceId}}/stop",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "agentorbit",
                "workspaces",
                "{{instanceId}}",
                "stop"
              ],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "key": "instanceId",
                  "value": "",
                  "description": "实例 ID"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "暂停实例，释放计算资源、保留存储与工作目录；不需要 userId。"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "1.4 重启实例",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-Open-Access-Token", "value": "{{openAccessToken}}", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/agentorbit/workspaces/{{instanceId}}/restart",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "agentorbit",
                "workspaces",
                "{{instanceId}}",
                "restart"
              ],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "key": "instanceId",
                  "value": "",
                  "description": "实例 ID"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "重启实例；重启期间 ACP 连接会断开，需要重新 connect + initialize；不需要 userId。"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. 连接与进入",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "2.1 进入实例",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-Open-Access-Token", "value": "{{openAccessToken}}", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "X-Asdm-Pat", "value": "{{asdmPat}}", "type": "text" },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/agentorbit/workspaces/{{instanceId}}/enter",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "agentorbit",
                "workspaces",
                "{{instanceId}}",
                "enter"
              ],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "key": "instanceId",
                  "value": "",
                  "description": "实例 ID"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "进入实例并确保成员环境：body 必传 userId，且**必须**带 X-Asdm-Pat 头（注入实例内 asdm CLI 凭据）；工作目录固定为成员默认工作目录 _default。",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"userId\": {{userId}}\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "2.2 获取连接信息",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-Open-Access-Token", "value": "{{openAccessToken}}", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "X-Asdm-Pat", "value": "{{asdmPat}}", "type": "text" },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/agentorbit/workspaces/{{instanceId}}/connect",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "agentorbit",
                "workspaces",
                "{{instanceId}}",
                "connect"
              ],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "key": "instanceId",
                  "value": "",
                  "description": "实例 ID"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "获取连接信息：body 必传 userId，且**必须**带 X-Asdm-Pat 头；工作目录为成员默认工作目录；返回 wsUrl 已包含 projectSlug，外部直接用于 WS。",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"userId\": {{userId}}\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "2.3 查询用户连接状态",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-Open-Access-Token", "value": "{{openAccessToken}}", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/agentorbit/workspaces/{{instanceId}}/connection-status?userId={{userId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "agentorbit",
                "workspaces",
                "{{instanceId}}",
                "connection-status"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "userId",
                  "value": "{{userId}}",
                  "description": "要查询的成员用户 ID"
                }
              ],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "key": "instanceId",
                  "value": "",
                  "description": "实例 ID"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "查询指定 userId（query 参数，必填）在该实例上是否有活跃 ACP 连接。\n\n只判断连接是否存在，不要求 initialize；返回 connected、connectionCount、connections。\n该接口不做归属校验，可查询任意 userId。"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. 会话",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "3.1 会话列表",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-Open-Access-Token", "value": "{{openAccessToken}}", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/agentorbit/workspaces/{{instanceId}}/sessions?userId={{userId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "agentorbit",
                "workspaces",
                "{{instanceId}}",
                "sessions"
              ],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "key": "instanceId",
                  "value": "",
                  "description": "实例 ID"
                }
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "userId",
                  "value": "{{userId}}",
                  "description": "成员用户 ID（必填）"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "查询会话列表；userId 必填（query）；返回该成员的全部会话。"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "3.2 创建会话",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (body && body.data && body.data.sessionId) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('sessionId', body.data.sessionId);",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('HTTP 2xx', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.within(200, 299));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-Open-Access-Token", "value": "{{openAccessToken}}", "type": "text" },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/agentorbit/workspaces/{{instanceId}}/sessions",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "agentorbit",
                "workspaces",
                "{{instanceId}}",
                "sessions"
              ],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "key": "instanceId",
                  "value": "",
                  "description": "实例 ID"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "在成员默认工作目录的活跃 ACP 连接上创建会话；body 必传 userId；成功后脚本写入 sessionId。",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"userId\": {{userId}}\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "3.3 删除会话",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-Open-Access-Token", "value": "{{openAccessToken}}", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/agentorbit/workspaces/{{instanceId}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}?userId={{userId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "agentorbit",
                "workspaces",
                "{{instanceId}}",
                "sessions",
                "{{sessionId}}"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "userId",
                  "value": "{{userId}}",
                  "description": "成员用户 ID（必填）"
                }
              ],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "key": "instanceId",
                  "value": "",
                  "description": "实例 ID"
                },
                {
                  "key": "sessionId",
                  "value": "",
                  "description": "会话 ID"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "删除指定会话；userId 必填（query，本请求无 body）。"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "3.4 获取会话可用模型",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (body && body.data && body.data.currentModel) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('modelId', body.data.currentModel);",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-Open-Access-Token", "value": "{{openAccessToken}}", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/agentorbit/workspaces/{{instanceId}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}/models?userId={{userId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "agentorbit",
                "workspaces",
                "{{instanceId}}",
                "sessions",
                "{{sessionId}}",
                "models"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "userId",
                  "value": "{{userId}}",
                  "description": "成员用户 ID（必填）"
                }
              ],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "key": "instanceId",
                  "value": "",
                  "description": "实例 ID"
                },
                {
                  "key": "sessionId",
                  "value": "",
                  "description": "会话 ID"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "获取指定会话的可用模型（会话维度）；userId 必填（query）。\n\n需要该会话在调用方活跃连接上创建/恢复；返回 currentModel + models。\n成功后脚本把 currentModel 写入集合变量 modelId。"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "3.5 切换会话模型",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (body && body.data && body.data.currentModel) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('modelId', body.data.currentModel);",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-Open-Access-Token", "value": "{{openAccessToken}}", "type": "text" },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"userId\": {{userId}},\n  \"model\": \"{{modelId}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/agentorbit/workspaces/{{instanceId}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}/model",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "agentorbit",
                "workspaces",
                "{{instanceId}}",
                "sessions",
                "{{sessionId}}",
                "model"
              ],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "key": "instanceId",
                  "value": "",
                  "description": "实例 ID"
                },
                {
                  "key": "sessionId",
                  "value": "",
                  "description": "会话 ID"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "切换指定会话所用模型；body 必传 userId。\n\n内部调用 ACP session/set_config_option（configId=model）；无活跃连接 409，未知模型 400。"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "3.6 获取会话历史",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (body && body.data && body.data.nextCursor) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('historyCursor', body.data.nextCursor);",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-Open-Access-Token", "value": "{{openAccessToken}}", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/agentorbit/workspaces/{{instanceId}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}/history?limit=50&userId={{userId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "agentorbit",
                "workspaces",
                "{{instanceId}}",
                "sessions",
                "{{sessionId}}",
                "history"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "50",
                  "description": "返回条数，默认 50，最大 200"
                },
                {
                  "key": "userId",
                  "value": "{{userId}}",
                  "description": "成员用户 ID（必填）"
                },
                {
                  "key": "before",
                  "value": "{{historyCursor}}",
                  "description": "上一页 nextCursor（首次调用留空）",
                  "disabled": true
                },
                {
                  "key": "include",
                  "value": "text,tool_use",
                  "description": "内容块过滤，逗号分隔",
                  "disabled": true
                },
                {
                  "key": "raw",
                  "value": "false",
                  "description": "附带原始 transcript 行",
                  "disabled": true
                }
              ],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "key": "instanceId",
                  "value": "",
                  "description": "实例 ID"
                },
                {
                  "key": "sessionId",
                  "value": "",
                  "description": "会话 ID"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "读取会话历史消息；userId 必填（query）。\n\n直接读实例内容器 agent 落盘的 transcript，不需要保持 ACP 连接，实例 running 即可；默认取最新 limit 条，用返回的 nextCursor 作为 before 翻更早的页。"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "3.7 停止生成",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-Open-Access-Token", "value": "{{openAccessToken}}", "type": "text" },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"userId\": {{userId}},\n  \"sessionId\": \"{{sessionId}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/agentorbit/workspaces/{{instanceId}}/generation/stop",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "agentorbit",
                "workspaces",
                "{{instanceId}}",
                "generation",
                "stop"
              ],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "key": "instanceId",
                  "value": "",
                  "description": "实例 ID"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "中断当前对话轮次（session/cancel）；body 必传 userId。"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4. 制品与文件",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "4.1 上传文件",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "const fullPath = body && body.data && body.data.path;",
                  "if (fullPath) {",
                  "  const marker = '/projects/_default/';",
                  "  const index = fullPath.indexOf(marker);",
                  "  if (index >= 0) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('filePath', fullPath.slice(index + marker.length));",
                  "  }",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-Open-Access-Token", "value": "{{openAccessToken}}", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "file",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": []
                },
                {
                  "key": "path",
                  "type": "text",
                  "value": "{{uploadPath}}",
                  "description": "目标目录（集合变量 uploadPath）；留空 = 工作目录根；相对路径拼在工作目录根后面。"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/agentorbit/workspaces/{{instanceId}}/artifacts?userId={{userId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "agentorbit",
                "workspaces",
                "{{instanceId}}",
                "artifacts"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "userId",
                  "value": "{{userId}}",
                  "description": "成员用户 ID（必填）"
                }
              ],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "key": "instanceId",
                  "value": "",
                  "description": "实例 ID"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "上传文件到成员默认工作目录：userId 必填（query）；path 相对工作目录根。"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "4.2 下载文件",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-Open-Access-Token", "value": "{{openAccessToken}}", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/agentorbit/workspaces/{{instanceId}}/artifacts?path={{filePath}}&userId={{userId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "agentorbit",
                "workspaces",
                "{{instanceId}}",
                "artifacts"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "path",
                  "value": "{{filePath}}",
                  "description": "相对于工作目录根的文件路径"
                },
                {
                  "key": "userId",
                  "value": "{{userId}}",
                  "description": "成员用户 ID（必填）"
                }
              ],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "key": "instanceId",
                  "value": "",
                  "description": "实例 ID"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "下载成员默认工作目录下的文件：userId 必填（query）；path 相对工作目录根。"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "4.3 上传制品到智能体空间",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (body && body.data && body.data.artifactId) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('artifactId', body.data.artifactId);",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-Open-Access-Token", "value": "{{openAccessToken}}", "type": "text" },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"userId\": {{userId}},\n  \"path\": \"{{artifactPath}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/agentorbit/workspaces/{{instanceId}}/workspace-artifacts",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "agentorbit",
                "workspaces",
                "{{instanceId}}",
                "workspace-artifacts"
              ],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "key": "instanceId",
                  "value": "",
                  "description": "实例 ID"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "从成员默认工作目录上传制品：body 必传 userId；path 相对工作目录根。"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "4.4 获取智能体空间制品列表",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (body && Array.isArray(body.data) && body.data.length > 0 && body.data[0].artifactId) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('artifactId', body.data[0].artifactId);",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-Open-Access-Token", "value": "{{openAccessToken}}", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/agentorbit/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/workspace-artifacts",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "agentorbit",
                "workspaces",
                "{{workspaceId}}",
                "workspace-artifacts"
              ],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "key": "workspaceId",
                  "value": "",
                  "description": "智能体空间 ID"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "对应项目 _artifacts/artifacts 页面列表，按智能体空间 ID 查询，只返回 sourceType=2 的 Active 制品；不需要 userId。"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "4.5 下载制品（按 artifactId，服务化）",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-Open-Access-Token", "value": "{{openAccessToken}}", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/agentorbit/workspaces/artifacts/{{artifactId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "agentorbit",
                "workspaces",
                "artifacts",
                "{{artifactId}}"
              ],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "key": "artifactId",
                  "value": "",
                  "description": "制品数据库 ID"
                }
              ]
